A note on what changed, and why it is recorded rather than quietly dropped:

Earlier revisions of this file named AGPL-3.0-only, and the reasoning was
sound for a different project — an app whose whole value is being honest about
where its numbers come from has a good argument for showing its working.
The decision was reversed deliberately.

Two consequences follow, and neither is undone by this file. Anything already
received by anybody under those terms was received under them, and a licence
already granted cannot be withdrawn from the copy it was granted on. And the
45 generated dish tiles were offered under CC0; copies already published stay
public domain. New work, and every copy from this revision forward, is under
the terms above.
